    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54563" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-αμπέχω</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-ίσχω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>encompass</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔψυχον ἄνδρα
				κούφῃ καταμπίσχουσιν ἐν τύμβῳ Χθονί</span>, i.e. bury
			him, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				853
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηκάδων μέλη, Χλόην καταμπέχοντα</span>
			<i>full of</i> green herbs, i.e. either <i>fed on grass</i> or
				<i>stuffed with herbs</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				1
			</span></i>; <i>cover</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κράνη -αμπέχοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Crass.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			.</div>
